    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "The gateway proxy publishes its metrics on `/stats/prometheus`, which Alloy only scrapes once the `prometheus.io/path` relabel rule in `infrastructure/base/alloy/config/metrics.alloy` is deployed. Until Argo has synced that, these four panels stay empty while the rest of the dashboard works."
      },
      "transparent": true,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "id": 11
    },
